WEBVTT

01:49.680 --> 01:52.480
SHUANGLIN GARDEN

02:02.840 --> 02:04.000
I will write your name
on the imperial edict

02:04.560 --> 02:05.600
for the arranged marriage.

02:09.680 --> 02:12.440
I know you were forced
into this situation, General Yin.

02:13.840 --> 02:16.760
However, I really cannot help with this.

02:17.840 --> 02:19.560
If you want to call off
the arranged marriage,

02:20.200 --> 02:22.840
actually, my fifth and eighth brothers
are more suitable than me.

02:25.480 --> 02:27.120
But I think you are the only one suitable.

02:33.120 --> 02:35.800
Don't you know why I planted
the plum tree in Prince Jing's Mansion?

02:37.040 --> 02:38.160
I thought one day,

02:38.760 --> 02:40.120
you would learn to appreciate
plum blossoms.

02:41.520 --> 02:43.840
I never appreciate or cherish flowers.

02:44.360 --> 02:45.920
You should have known it.

02:46.000 --> 02:46.840
I know it.

02:47.920 --> 02:49.080
Just because I know it,

02:50.520 --> 02:52.160
I didn't dare to express it
all these years.

02:53.800 --> 02:56.480
- Luomei.
- Generals must first cultivate their mind.

02:57.200 --> 02:58.640
A peaceful mind leads to success.

02:59.400 --> 03:01.400
Didn't we recite these military texts
together? Have you forgotten?

03:03.000 --> 03:04.640
You said you wanted to be a great general,

03:04.720 --> 03:06.560
that you wouldn't be wavered
by romantic feelings,

03:07.400 --> 03:09.640
and that no one would be able
to disrupt your composure.

03:11.000 --> 03:12.480
Did you lie to me about all that?

03:14.400 --> 03:16.360
It's not that you don't
appreciate flowers.

03:18.240 --> 03:19.400
You just don't like me.

03:21.280 --> 03:22.240
So far,

03:23.360 --> 03:27.000
I still don't appreciate flowers.

03:30.520 --> 03:31.880
If you really don't appreciate flowers,

03:34.080 --> 03:35.040
what does Mei Lin mean to you?

03:42.400 --> 03:43.360
Do you know

03:44.520 --> 03:47.520
there is a kind of wild flower
called Undying Flower?

03:49.240 --> 03:50.840
They have slender bodies

03:51.440 --> 03:52.760
but incredibly resilient roots.

03:54.640 --> 03:56.040
Given just a little bit of moisture,

03:57.440 --> 03:59.280
they will bloom vigorously.

04:01.200 --> 04:04.240
They never bloom for the sake of those
who appreciate flowers,

04:05.520 --> 04:06.680
but yet they always unexpectedly

04:07.320 --> 04:10.640
catch the attention of passersby.

04:11.520 --> 04:12.880
Unable to avoid them,

04:13.920 --> 04:15.800
people stop to admire

04:16.760 --> 04:17.720
and marvel at them,

04:19.120 --> 04:19.959
becoming enamored,

04:21.920 --> 04:22.760
and even…

04:27.760 --> 04:29.840
and even longing to be with them
for a lifetime.

04:49.080 --> 04:50.680
The imperial edict
for the arranged marriage?

04:50.760 --> 04:51.840
Yes, Your Highness.

04:51.920 --> 04:53.120
General Yin promised

04:53.200 --> 04:55.160
to give His Majesty an answer
after the spring hunt.

04:55.240 --> 04:57.760
Your Highness,
His Majesty asked Prince Jing to go too.

04:58.360 --> 05:00.600
His Majesty wants to matchmake
General Yin and Prince Jing.

05:00.680 --> 05:03.440
General Yin says she likes Prince Jing
and will write his name--

05:10.520 --> 05:11.840
Your Highness.

05:15.080 --> 05:16.160
It's not your turn to tell me

05:17.560 --> 05:19.280
whom she likes.

05:30.680 --> 05:33.560
Your Highness, if Prince Jing
has General Yin's assistance…

05:35.880 --> 05:37.160
Since it's a spring hunt,

05:38.240 --> 05:39.840
swords and blades can be unpredictable.

05:48.240 --> 05:49.640
You are so stubborn.

05:50.640 --> 05:52.560
No wonder it's hard for you
to get a live-in husband.

05:54.240 --> 05:56.800
If you really can't let go
of Miss Mei Lin,

05:57.320 --> 05:58.920
you might as well put on a show
before His Majesty

05:59.000 --> 05:59.840
and bring Ms. Mei Lin back.

05:59.920 --> 06:01.120
What show should I put on?

06:01.200 --> 06:03.160
Just show His Majesty

06:03.240 --> 06:05.520
you are deeply in love with Miss Mei Lin.

06:05.600 --> 06:08.320
If you can't see her,
you can't eat or sleep properly.

06:10.840 --> 06:12.560
So, you know it, huh?

06:12.640 --> 06:13.560
Of course.

06:13.640 --> 06:15.600
I've been serving you for so many years.

06:15.680 --> 06:17.120
I can see it.

06:17.720 --> 06:20.680
Ever since you had that argument
with Miss Mei Lin,

06:20.760 --> 06:22.240
you've been worried sick every day,

06:22.320 --> 06:24.200
and you've even been
staying up later than usual.

06:25.080 --> 06:26.880
So, I concluded

06:26.960 --> 06:30.040
you must be afraid Miss Mei Lin
will act on her own authority

06:30.120 --> 06:31.720
and ruin our plan, right?

06:33.560 --> 06:35.160
Nonsense.

06:35.240 --> 06:36.760
Go to the West Mountain Mine
to catch that guy.

06:37.480 --> 06:38.640
No need for you to worry about Mei Lin.

06:39.160 --> 06:41.280
At the spring hunt,
we'll have a tough battle to fight.

06:41.960 --> 06:43.120
Yes.

06:57.240 --> 07:00.080
During the spring hunt,
there will be danger.

07:01.920 --> 07:03.600
It might be a good thing

07:03.680 --> 07:05.000
that you stay in the Fanghua Palace.

07:05.960 --> 07:07.040
Live on well.

07:07.560 --> 07:08.560
You shouldn't suffer

07:10.000 --> 07:11.680
all this.

07:17.520 --> 07:19.920
WEST MOUNTAIN MINE

07:20.000 --> 07:22.640
The West Mountain Mine. Li Qing.

07:23.800 --> 07:24.760
Mei Lin.

07:27.840 --> 07:29.680
- Mei Lin.
- Your Highness.

07:30.560 --> 07:31.800
Why haven't you changed your clothes yet?

07:31.880 --> 07:33.400
Your Highness,

07:33.480 --> 07:34.720
can I not go to the hunting ground?

07:36.160 --> 07:37.000
Why?

07:37.600 --> 07:38.760
I heard that all members
of the imperial clan and ministers

07:38.840 --> 07:41.400
will be participating in this spring hunt.

07:42.040 --> 07:43.240
I don't want to see Prince Jing.

07:44.000 --> 07:45.080
Fine.

07:47.280 --> 07:49.680
I've heard that there are red foxes
spotted on the Lushan Hunting Ground.

07:49.760 --> 07:51.640
Let me hunt one and make a fur collar
out of it for you.

07:51.720 --> 07:53.480
My archery on horseback
was taught by my brother,

07:53.560 --> 07:55.720
- and it's quite impressive.
- Thank you, Your Highness.

07:57.360 --> 07:59.200
Take good care of yourself
at the Fanghua Palace.

08:00.960 --> 08:01.800
Your Highness.

08:03.640 --> 08:05.040
Your Highness, it's time to go.

08:05.120 --> 08:06.520
Otherwise, we will miss
the hunting ceremony.

08:07.280 --> 08:09.160
- I'm leaving.
- Go ahead.

08:10.240 --> 08:11.080
Let's go.

08:20.400 --> 08:24.000
The Lushan Hunting Ground is a necessary
route to the West Mountain Mine.

08:24.080 --> 08:27.440
Before it's done,
I can't make the princess worry.

08:27.520 --> 08:29.800
LUSHAN HUNTING GROUND TERRAIN

08:41.919 --> 08:43.919
- Greetings, Your Majesty.
- Greetings, Your Majesty.

08:44.000 --> 08:44.960
As you were.

08:45.040 --> 08:46.600
Thank you, Your Majesty.

08:48.280 --> 08:51.520
Since ancient times, the hunting rituals
must follow the seasons.

08:52.120 --> 08:53.440
The spring hunt is a ritual
to thank the gods

08:53.520 --> 08:56.680
and pray for the prosperity
of our Great Yan.

08:56.760 --> 08:59.040
Today, all the valiant sons of Great Yan

08:59.120 --> 09:00.480
have gathered on the hunting ground.

09:00.560 --> 09:01.920
Such a grand occasion

09:02.000 --> 09:03.760
is sure to ensure that our Great Yan

09:03.840 --> 09:05.240
enjoys favorable weather

09:05.840 --> 09:07.840
and continuous prosperity
in the coming year.

09:08.560 --> 09:10.640
Your Majesty, it's time.

09:24.680 --> 09:25.520
Start hunting!

09:51.520 --> 09:52.520
I have long heard

09:52.600 --> 09:54.400
of your excellent equestrian
archery skills, Concubine Yan.

09:55.680 --> 09:57.120
Why don't we have a contest today?

09:59.120 --> 09:59.960
Sure.

10:00.760 --> 10:04.400
Your Majesty, I once hunted a white bear.

10:05.560 --> 10:08.880
If you can hunt a white bear today,
I will admit defeat.

10:08.960 --> 10:10.000
Really?

10:10.840 --> 10:14.120
Your Highness,
His Majesty is joking with you.

10:14.200 --> 10:15.800
Great Yan is on the Central Plains.

10:15.880 --> 10:17.800
How can there be any white bears?

10:19.880 --> 10:21.160
Then, how will we decide
who wins and who loses?

10:21.240 --> 10:23.760
- You want to defeat me so much?
- Of course.

10:23.840 --> 10:25.720
Your Majesty, you've promised me

10:25.800 --> 10:28.320
that as long as I win,
you'll fulfill one wish of mine.

10:29.160 --> 10:31.280
You can tell me what you want directly.

10:31.360 --> 10:32.520
No.

10:33.200 --> 10:34.640
I have to win before I tell Your Majesty.

10:34.720 --> 10:36.280
Whatever you want to compete with me,
I'll agree.

10:41.880 --> 10:43.800
Let's just have a horse race.

10:43.880 --> 10:47.240
Whoever reaches the wood ahead first
will be the winner.

10:49.320 --> 10:50.400
Aren't we going to have
an equestrian archery contest?

10:51.680 --> 10:53.240
I don't want to crush Your Majesty.

11:59.680 --> 12:00.520
Your Majesty.

12:00.600 --> 12:02.600
Your Majesty, I've lost.

12:04.560 --> 12:07.440
If your wish is to go back to Xiyan,

12:07.520 --> 12:08.360
I won't agree.

12:10.200 --> 12:12.760
If I knew your riding skills
were so excellent,

12:12.840 --> 12:14.040
I wouldn't have competed
with Your Majesty.

12:15.000 --> 12:17.680
When His Majesty was a prince,

12:17.760 --> 12:20.920
he never lost an equestrian archery
contest to other princes.

12:23.840 --> 12:25.880
How can I defeat Your Majesty then?

12:26.800 --> 12:28.160
Concubine Yan, you are very smart.

12:28.960 --> 12:30.720
As long as you can fall in love
with this place,

12:31.280 --> 12:32.240
you can defeat me.

12:35.440 --> 12:37.000
Your Majesty, do you mean

12:37.720 --> 12:39.600
you will take me to Lushan often?

12:41.200 --> 12:42.800
When I have time, I will take you here.

12:42.880 --> 12:44.400
- Really?
- The Emperor does not speak lightly.

12:45.760 --> 12:47.560
Take Concubine Yan to have a rest.

12:47.640 --> 12:48.680
Come.

12:55.040 --> 12:56.840
Your Majesty, in one year,

12:56.920 --> 12:58.040
I will surpass you.

12:58.120 --> 12:59.040
Okay.

13:11.560 --> 13:13.120
Concubine Yan is naturally carefree.

13:14.080 --> 13:15.160
It's indeed a hardship for her

13:16.080 --> 13:17.320
to stay in the palace all day.

13:17.920 --> 13:18.920
Yes, Your Majesty.

13:25.120 --> 13:27.320
Did you hear Yin Luomei
is going to choose a husband?

13:27.400 --> 13:29.280
She will choose the champion of this year.

13:30.000 --> 13:31.720
Could His Majesty place his bet
on Prince Jing as well?

13:32.520 --> 13:35.680
Everybody knows Prince Jing
is often the top one in Lushan Hunt.

13:39.360 --> 13:40.640
- Let's go.
- Hurry up.

13:40.720 --> 13:41.800
Let's go.

13:43.040 --> 13:43.920
General,

13:44.000 --> 13:44.960
the imperial edict for the arranged
marriage has been issued.

13:45.040 --> 13:47.400
Even if Prince Jing is unwilling,
he has to accept it.

13:57.880 --> 14:01.000
The Lushan Hunting Ground is just 50 li
from the West Mountain Mine.

14:01.080 --> 14:02.760
If I encounter danger and go missing
on the hunting ground,

14:02.840 --> 14:04.040
Father will definitely send

14:04.120 --> 14:06.080
the Lulin Army stationed
at the West Mountain Mine

14:06.160 --> 14:07.000
to search the mountains.

14:07.560 --> 14:10.320
That will be your best opportunity
to capture Li Qing.

14:12.040 --> 14:14.440
My lord, when I'm not by your side,
please be careful.

14:14.520 --> 14:16.640
Don't worry. Go now.

14:16.720 --> 14:18.720
If anything happens,
use a pigeon to send me a message.

14:19.360 --> 14:20.480
Yes.

14:28.440 --> 14:30.440
Is Mei Lin still in Fanghua Palace?

14:30.520 --> 14:31.360
Yes.

14:31.880 --> 14:35.680
Concubine Yan's maid said
Mei Lin didn't want to see you,

14:35.760 --> 14:37.520
so she stayed in the Fanghua Palace.

14:42.840 --> 14:44.080
Okay.

14:52.600 --> 14:53.680
Third Brother,

14:53.760 --> 14:55.760
everyone says
you are highly skilled in archery

14:55.840 --> 14:57.680
and that you must be the top one
in this spring hunt.

14:58.400 --> 15:00.840
But I don't think it's for sure.

15:04.120 --> 15:05.760
You are right, Big Brother.

15:05.840 --> 15:08.480
I haven't participated
in spring hunt for many years.

15:11.200 --> 15:13.320
It was all in the past.

15:19.760 --> 15:21.520
Your Highness, as planned, Yang Zhen

15:21.600 --> 15:23.480
has released the prisoners of war
from the West Mountain Mine.

15:24.120 --> 15:25.280
In six hours,

15:25.360 --> 15:27.640
there will be traces
of the Xiyan prisoners of war in Lushan.

15:28.240 --> 15:30.720
When our assassins disguise themselves
as prisoners of war

15:31.960 --> 15:33.400
to carry out the assassination,
even if it fails,

15:33.480 --> 15:35.320
Yang Zhen will be held responsible.

15:42.920 --> 15:45.800
This assassination during the hunt
must succeed.

15:45.880 --> 15:46.920
You are not allowed to fail.

15:47.560 --> 15:48.440
Understood.

16:01.640 --> 16:04.080
I will reach the West Mountain Mine
after climbing over two mountains.

16:04.160 --> 16:05.000
Stop there!

16:17.720 --> 16:19.680
Aren't you Prince Jing's Beauty?

16:20.280 --> 16:21.520
Why aren't you with Concubine Yan?

16:21.600 --> 16:22.960
And you are dressed like this.

16:26.440 --> 16:29.160
Beauty, I've long been interested in you.

16:30.080 --> 16:31.520
With your looks,

16:31.600 --> 16:33.320
I didn't expect Prince Jing
to let you go so soon.

16:33.400 --> 16:34.520
What a pity.

16:38.640 --> 16:40.640
How dare you touch my woman!

16:40.720 --> 16:43.040
I can cripple you at will.

16:44.520 --> 16:46.120
Your Highness, I'm sorry.

16:46.200 --> 16:48.200
I… I'll leave now.

16:48.280 --> 16:49.560
Stop there.

16:52.400 --> 16:53.600
If you dare

16:53.680 --> 16:55.800
to leak anything about what happened here,

16:55.880 --> 16:59.200
Princess Hengyang will have
to arrange her son's funeral.

16:59.280 --> 17:01.080
Understood,

17:01.160 --> 17:03.920
Your Highness. I didn't see anyone.
I got hurt by myself.

17:04.000 --> 17:05.319
Get lost.

17:14.920 --> 17:17.520
There are many patrolling Imperial Guards
on the Lushan Hunting Ground.

17:17.599 --> 17:19.119
Aren't you afraid
of implicating Concubine Yan?

17:19.960 --> 17:21.440
There are no Imperial Guards
patrolling here.

17:21.520 --> 17:23.240
You haven't seen me,

17:24.040 --> 17:25.359
and Concubine Yan won't be implicated.

17:28.079 --> 17:29.720
You're familiar with the terrain
of the hunting ground.

17:29.800 --> 17:31.040
It seems you are well-prepared.

17:31.120 --> 17:33.280
Are you going to the West Mountain Mine
to find the witness?

17:33.360 --> 17:34.400
Whatever I do

17:35.320 --> 17:36.360
has nothing to do with you.

17:50.480 --> 17:52.520
General, inspection of this area
is complete.

17:52.600 --> 17:54.320
- Go over there to take a look.
- Yes.

17:59.920 --> 18:01.680
Play along with me.

18:01.760 --> 18:03.800
Otherwise, you'll be known
as the assassin of a prince.

18:07.280 --> 18:08.200
Nothing here.

18:09.680 --> 18:10.720
I'll go over there to take a look.

18:12.000 --> 18:12.840
Let's go over there.

18:13.640 --> 18:14.640
Nothing here either.

18:16.080 --> 18:17.240
Nothing here.

18:17.320 --> 18:18.320
Nothing here either.

18:41.520 --> 18:43.560
You taught me this.

18:44.320 --> 18:45.600
If we are discovered,

18:46.280 --> 18:48.520
you won't be able to go
to the West Mountain Mine.

19:34.200 --> 19:35.240
That's outrageous.

20:27.520 --> 20:29.360
The assassins disguised themselves
as the prisoners of war.

20:30.200 --> 20:32.480
It seems the Crown Prince

20:32.560 --> 20:34.400
borrowed help
from the West Mountain Mine this time.

20:34.920 --> 20:37.400
Carry these two bodies
to a conspicuous place.

20:38.040 --> 20:39.040
Also,

20:39.120 --> 20:40.840
you two will follow Mei Lin

20:40.920 --> 20:42.480
and ensure her safety.

20:43.120 --> 20:46.400
The rest of you will cover for me
to the Sunset Cliff.

20:47.200 --> 20:48.040
- Yes.
- Yes.

21:01.880 --> 21:02.840
Your Highness,

21:02.920 --> 21:04.760
our people were nearly discovered
by General Yin.

21:04.840 --> 21:06.600
We've lost track of them.

21:06.680 --> 21:07.920
We can't succeed in one go.

21:08.000 --> 21:08.880
Send more people.

21:08.960 --> 21:10.120
Don't give them any chance
to catch their breath.

21:10.200 --> 21:11.200
Understood.

21:40.120 --> 21:42.800
Luomei, are you sure
this isn't just hearsay?

21:43.520 --> 21:45.680
I've never seen any red foxes
on the Lushan Hunting Ground.

21:46.960 --> 21:48.600
Anyway, you have to hunt
the foxes with me.

21:48.680 --> 21:50.560
Since you've lost,
you have to keep your word.

21:59.680 --> 22:00.960
According to legend,

22:01.040 --> 22:02.760
if two people see a red fox together,

22:03.400 --> 22:05.280
they will love each other forever.

22:44.040 --> 22:46.320
Are you upset about choosing a husband?

22:47.000 --> 22:48.440
Did my aunt tell Your Highness that?

22:49.760 --> 22:51.120
There is no need for Her Highness
to remind me that.

22:51.720 --> 22:53.440
She just encouraged me
to win the first place.

22:55.400 --> 22:58.920
But I know you've made a choice, General.

23:01.000 --> 23:02.880
Why should I force my will on anyone?

23:03.600 --> 23:04.440
If possible,

23:05.120 --> 23:08.160
I'm willing to guard the frontier
and never get married in my life.

23:08.240 --> 23:09.800
But I'm a daughter of the Yin family.

23:11.080 --> 23:12.600
I can't decide my marriage.

23:16.320 --> 23:17.400
There's a way.

23:18.800 --> 23:21.880
In this spring hunt,
as long as you can win the first place,

23:22.880 --> 23:25.320
you can tell my father to postpone it.

23:26.080 --> 23:27.200
I'm willing to give

23:27.280 --> 23:29.160
the prey I've hunted to you.

23:36.080 --> 23:37.080
I certainly hope

23:37.680 --> 23:39.040
you can write my name

23:39.560 --> 23:40.680
in the imperial edict
for the arranged marriage.

23:47.120 --> 23:48.360
But other than that,

23:49.000 --> 23:51.080
I wish you could still live
as you did before,

23:52.320 --> 23:54.880
daring to love and hate
and being carefree and bold.

23:57.960 --> 23:58.800
Luomei,

23:59.480 --> 24:01.200
as long as I, Murong Xuanlie, am alive,

24:02.400 --> 24:05.840
I won't let anything upset you.

24:24.320 --> 24:26.040
The legend about the red foxes
in Lushan is true.

24:47.360 --> 24:48.240
Perhaps…

24:50.800 --> 24:54.240
I shouldn't use this knife now.

25:14.440 --> 25:15.800
I need to arrive before dark

25:16.320 --> 25:18.040
to have a chance to sneak
into the West Mountain Mine.

25:56.360 --> 25:57.880
Killing him is too merciful.

25:57.960 --> 25:59.600
What we should do

25:59.680 --> 26:02.120
is make him atone
for Qingzhou's 100,000 souls,

26:02.720 --> 26:04.760
for the innocent Weibei soldiers who died.

26:10.960 --> 26:12.920
Your Highness, two people died.

26:13.000 --> 26:16.000
It seems Prince Jing
is well-prepared for this spring hunt.

26:16.640 --> 26:17.840
Time is limited.

26:17.920 --> 26:19.560
We must kill him
before the Imperial Guards.

26:20.160 --> 26:22.280
Rest assured, Your Highness.
Prince Jing is doomed to die.

26:30.600 --> 26:32.080
He is deeply scheming.

26:32.640 --> 26:33.840
I don't need to worry about him.

26:53.360 --> 26:55.760
He was General Weibei back then.
Attack him together!

26:55.840 --> 26:57.000
- Kill him!
- Kill him!

26:57.080 --> 26:58.560
- Kill him!
- Kill him!

27:03.520 --> 27:04.600
Real prisoners of war?

28:08.040 --> 28:09.440
Why did you come back to save me?

28:10.400 --> 28:11.440
Out of instinct.

28:13.200 --> 28:14.200
I'm different from you.

28:15.560 --> 28:16.840
I can't watch anyone die in vain.

28:21.000 --> 28:22.480
I'm truly blessed by the gods.

28:23.440 --> 28:25.160
If there weren't a deep pool
below the cliff,

28:26.040 --> 28:28.480
we would have died here.

28:38.280 --> 28:40.880
You already knew there is a deep pool
below the cliff?

28:42.080 --> 28:43.480
You tried to escape in this way?

28:46.120 --> 28:47.240
With your scheming personality,

28:47.840 --> 28:50.040
how could you not anticipate
the Crown Prince's murderous intent?

28:51.080 --> 28:52.400
I shouldn't have come back.

28:54.680 --> 28:55.640
You can't leave.

28:56.360 --> 28:58.840
I told you I didn't want to go with you.

28:58.920 --> 29:00.640
Now that you've come back to me,

29:00.720 --> 29:01.920
I won't let you leave me again.

29:02.520 --> 29:04.080
It's not up to you.

29:04.160 --> 29:05.240
It's getting dark.

29:05.800 --> 29:08.640
Without me, do you think
you can leave here alive?

29:08.720 --> 29:10.040
No need for you to worry about me.

29:10.120 --> 29:12.280
It's useless for you to go
to the West Mountain Mine.

29:12.840 --> 29:14.480
Li Qing can only be at my disposal.

29:14.560 --> 29:17.600
If you dare to ruin my plan,
I will kill you.

29:19.240 --> 29:20.600
I can kill you now.

29:26.160 --> 29:27.000
Watch out.

29:46.680 --> 29:49.760
You and I are on the same path

29:50.440 --> 29:51.640
and share the same goal.

29:52.200 --> 29:53.320
Stay.

29:54.440 --> 29:55.640
Stay by my side.

30:01.520 --> 30:02.520
The snake is venomous.

30:03.440 --> 30:05.560
To survive, you need to drain
the blood immediately.

30:08.960 --> 30:10.240
I know that.

30:32.720 --> 30:34.160
The snake venom has paralyzed your leg.

30:34.800 --> 30:35.640
You must detoxify.

30:35.720 --> 30:37.280
I'll send you back to Lushan.

30:37.360 --> 30:39.960
Not necessary.
Follow the stream downstream.

30:40.040 --> 30:43.080
There's a hunter's cabin
where there's medicine.

30:49.600 --> 30:51.160
Whatever plan you have,

30:51.240 --> 30:52.680
I can't watch an innocent man die in vain.

30:52.760 --> 30:54.000
Don't worry.

30:55.000 --> 30:56.040
This time,

30:56.880 --> 30:58.080
I myself is the bait.

31:29.360 --> 31:31.040
It's Prince Jing's arrow.
Hurry up and report it.

31:31.120 --> 31:31.960
Yes.

31:32.600 --> 31:34.760
How could there be prisoners of war
on the royal hunting ground?

31:35.360 --> 31:37.480
The West Mountain Mine
is 50 li away from here.

31:37.560 --> 31:39.600
Most of the workers there
are Xiyan prisoners of war.

31:39.680 --> 31:41.600
Escapes by prisoners of war are common.

31:42.240 --> 31:45.160
Perhaps there was a lapse
among the Imperial Guards.

31:46.880 --> 31:48.440
Your Majesty, it's a dereliction
of duty on my part.

31:48.520 --> 31:49.800
Please pardon me.

31:51.000 --> 31:53.800
Father, General Yin has only recently
taken command of the Imperial Guards,

31:53.880 --> 31:55.840
so it's inevitable that there would be
some lapses among the troops.

31:56.960 --> 31:58.040
Get up.

32:01.640 --> 32:04.800
The urgent task now is to find Jinghe.

32:06.160 --> 32:07.160
Your Majesty,

32:07.240 --> 32:09.680
these prisoners of war
are all soldiers who have gone to war.

32:10.280 --> 32:12.840
Now they are cornered and desperate,
so we cannot let our guard down.

32:13.440 --> 32:14.680
I propose that the Imperial Guards

32:14.760 --> 32:16.040
seal off the mountain
and conduct a thorough search.

32:21.160 --> 32:24.600
Father, sealing off the mountain for
a search will require a lot of manpower,

32:25.240 --> 32:26.640
leaving the hunting palace
understaffed and at risk.

32:27.400 --> 32:29.240
General Yin,
please stay and protect my father.

32:29.320 --> 32:30.920
I request to go search for Jinghe.

32:31.000 --> 32:33.520
I will find Jinghe before it's dark.

32:33.600 --> 32:34.920
Your Majesty, I also…

32:35.000 --> 32:35.960
I know

32:37.000 --> 32:39.000
if you stay at the hunting palace,
you'll be worried.

32:42.040 --> 32:43.680
General Yin, go to the West Mountain Mine

32:44.400 --> 32:45.760
and mobilize the Lulin Army for support.

32:45.840 --> 32:47.320
The escape of the prisoners of war

32:48.200 --> 32:49.200
is their responsibility.

32:50.600 --> 32:52.360
Understood, Your Majesty.

33:03.640 --> 33:04.640
Search carefully.

33:04.720 --> 33:05.560
You go over there.

33:05.640 --> 33:06.520
- Yes.
- Yes.

33:06.600 --> 33:07.480
Yes.

33:08.080 --> 33:09.440
Let's go over there.

33:09.520 --> 33:11.120
The hunting ground
is full of fierce birds.

33:11.200 --> 33:12.920
- Let's hope nothing bad has happened.
- Here.

33:13.880 --> 33:14.720
Search carefully.

33:15.440 --> 33:16.520
General,

33:16.600 --> 33:17.880
Mei Lin can't be found
on the hunting ground.

33:17.960 --> 33:20.000
Could Prince Jing's disappearance
be related to her?

33:22.080 --> 33:22.960
Perhaps.

33:23.040 --> 33:25.440
No matter what,
let's first find Prince Jing.

33:31.680 --> 33:33.640
Your Highness, in at most a day,

33:33.720 --> 33:35.840
we can finish searching
the entire Lushan Hunting Ground.

33:35.920 --> 33:37.120
Prince Jing will definitely be found.

33:37.200 --> 33:38.040
However,

33:38.120 --> 33:39.720
General Yin will bring the troops back

33:39.800 --> 33:41.600
within a day. Well…

33:42.200 --> 33:43.360
Send a message to Yang Zhen

33:43.440 --> 33:44.400
to have him stall them
as much as possible.

33:45.000 --> 33:46.320
I'm afraid Yang Zhen will fail.

33:46.920 --> 33:49.320
Tell him to do his best.
Remember, just stall them.

33:49.400 --> 33:50.680
- Don't offend them.
- Yes, Your Highness.

33:55.720 --> 33:57.080
Murong Jinghe,

33:57.680 --> 33:59.200
you should have disappeared
from this world

33:59.280 --> 34:01.200
ten years ago.

34:05.160 --> 34:07.520
Let's take a break. I can't walk anymore.

34:34.560 --> 34:35.880
What does this horn signal mean?

34:37.560 --> 34:38.719
My father has ordered the end of the hunt

34:38.800 --> 34:39.719
and the sealing of the mountain.

34:43.960 --> 34:45.760
What exactly is your plan?

34:46.960 --> 34:49.520
The commander at the West Mountain Mine
works for the Eastern Palace.

34:50.080 --> 34:53.600
I deliberately staged
an accident and disappearance

34:53.679 --> 34:56.360
to give Qing Yan a chance
to capture Li Qing.

35:00.400 --> 35:02.560
So, you released the prisoners of war
in the West Mountain

35:02.640 --> 35:04.000
to create chaos?

35:06.640 --> 35:08.880
They are scapegoats released
by the Crown Prince.

35:10.400 --> 35:11.600
In the Battle of Qiujiang,

35:12.440 --> 35:14.200
I decisively defeated the Xiyan army.

35:14.280 --> 35:16.080
Their general committed suicide.

35:16.640 --> 35:17.720
The rest prisoners of war

35:18.320 --> 35:20.200
were locked up to do labor
in the West Mountain Mine.

35:20.800 --> 35:23.240
The Qiujiang prisoners of war
escaped to the hunting ground,

35:23.840 --> 35:26.320
intending to take revenge and kill me.

35:27.240 --> 35:28.360
It makes sense.

35:29.440 --> 35:32.200
If the Crown Prince
leads the search and seals the mountain,

35:33.080 --> 35:34.560
won't we become birds in a cage?

35:34.640 --> 35:36.360
They are sealing Lushan.

35:37.040 --> 35:39.160
Here is Zhongshan.

35:46.240 --> 35:48.120
The snake venom has paralyzed his nerves.

35:57.040 --> 35:59.200
I'm thirsty. Get some water for me.

36:00.440 --> 36:01.400
- Let me help you.
- Hurry up!

36:03.120 --> 36:03.920
Go!

41:17.680 --> 41:20.960
HUNTER'S CABIN

41:56.000 --> 41:57.600
You've taken the antidote.

41:58.240 --> 41:59.880
The snake venom will soon be neutralized.

42:04.000 --> 42:04.880
Thank you.

42:14.080 --> 42:15.640
I once spent three years

42:16.720 --> 42:18.400
as a cripple
unable to take care of myself.

42:20.360 --> 42:22.480
The pain and humiliation during that time

42:23.320 --> 42:24.840
were far worse than today's.

42:26.880 --> 42:28.440
During my nightmares,

42:29.320 --> 42:30.200
I felt resentment,

42:31.080 --> 42:31.920
hatred,

42:33.400 --> 42:34.520
and regret,

42:36.560 --> 42:39.480
for following the order
not to harm civilians,

42:39.560 --> 42:41.360
which allowed Li Qing to escape.

42:42.200 --> 42:44.280
Stop! Don't point blades at the civilians.

42:44.920 --> 42:46.160
Otherwise,

42:47.400 --> 42:48.640
the battle for revenge

42:49.720 --> 42:51.720
wouldn't have been so difficult.

42:55.440 --> 42:56.960
Actually, I admire you very much.

42:59.360 --> 43:01.680
We both crawled out
of the pile of dead bodies.

43:02.360 --> 43:06.400
Yet, you have always been a good person.

43:08.880 --> 43:10.160
Being a good person

43:11.920 --> 43:13.480
comes with a price.

43:16.360 --> 43:19.440
General Weibei bore a tarnished name

43:21.080 --> 43:23.720
but continued to protect the people
until the very end.

43:24.720 --> 43:25.760
He is a good man

43:26.640 --> 43:27.520
and a hero.

43:29.080 --> 43:30.160
I admire him very much.

43:37.480 --> 43:39.000
The current Prince Jing

43:41.080 --> 43:43.000
is not worthy of being General Weibei.

43:43.080 --> 43:45.120
They have always been the same person.

43:47.120 --> 43:49.240
If the events from back then
were to happen again,

43:50.560 --> 43:53.600
I'm not sure whether I would
make the same decision as before.

43:57.400 --> 43:58.840
Once we win this battle

44:00.880 --> 44:02.720
and expose the truth about Qingzhou,

44:06.040 --> 44:07.560
I will take full responsibility

44:09.360 --> 44:11.160
for the debts owed…

44:18.080 --> 44:19.080
even if…

44:21.680 --> 44:22.880
it costs me my life.
